    "summary": [
      "L1: No human reviewer and no language-model reviewer was measured anywhere in this unit.",
      "L2: Identity blinding is verified against a declared token vocabulary, not against every possible identity channel.",
      "L3: The attractiveness of the seeded false claim is measured by a declared textual rule, not by any observed reader response.",
      "L4: The seeded case contains exactly one false claim of exactly one kind.",
      "L5: The value of the ordering gate rests on a modelled menu of alternative weightings.",
      "L6: This unit's own hypothesis CM-H8, that the ordering gate has marginal value under blinding, is refuted on the metric it preregistered.",
      "L7: M5 and M6 are proposals against a read-only control, not applied changes.",
      "L8: One declared external source was not readable from this runtime.",
      "L9: Byte-identical replay covers the review path, not the two evidence documents that record wall time and live external retrieval.",
      "L10: The candidate pool is five submissions and the design is a complete crossing, not a sample."
    ]
